    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Moses Mutente, a well-known name in Tanzanian media, is taking his career to new heights by pursuing a Master's in Strategic Communications at Aga Khan University (AKU). With a passion for communication, leadership, and social change, Moses is driven to make a lasting impact.",
